     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{x^2} + 2x - 15 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left({x - 3} \\right)\\left({x + 5} \\right) = 0\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Factor the polynomial.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x - 3 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"x + 5 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td>Set factors equal to zero.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = 3\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = - 5\"></span></td>\n<td>Solve each new equation.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Checking is left to you.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"x = 3\">x = 2</span> or <span data-math=\"x = - 5\">x = - 5</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
